# INTERFACE VERSION: 16001 is the number used by ForeverAuras, which loads
# without the "out of date" warning in WoW Forever 1.60.x. If Forever patches
# and the add-on list starts showing "Out of date", type this in game:
#
#     /dump (select(4, GetBuildInfo()))
#
# and put the number it prints on the "## Interface:" line above.
